{
  "name": "Boomerang",
  "label": "BOOMERANG / 19",
  "finish": {
    "x": 780,
    "y": null
  },
  "description": "Turning around in the air, four times, up a tower of ledges. Each kicker curls past vertical, so it throws you straight up and slightly back. Hold the gas all the way in, level the bike as it rises, press turn (Space) near the top and land facing back on the ledge above the run-up. The grass kicker lands you on the dirt ledge, the dirt kicker on the boardwalk, the boardwalk kicker on the stone ledge, and the stone kicker on the summit with the finish. Apples hang in three of the throws, so a full-speed run collects them on the way. A short throw drops you back onto the run-up below.",
